      <p>
        Most beauty stores do not need the most powerful app. They need the one that does the job they have now at a price they can carry for the next year. The decision table below maps common beauty needs to the app most likely to fit, with the reason in the last column. Treat it as a starting filter, then test the two or three apps that come out of it with your own product data.
      </p>
    </div>
